# Explorations (task invariants)

When editing `src/explorations/` or shared `src/eComponents/`:

## Taxonomies

Read valid IDs from source — do not guess:

- `src/explorations/TOPICS.ts` — static set
- `src/explorations/TIMELINE.ts` — hardforks + maturity stages
- `src/explorations/TAGS.ts` — enum; new tags must follow [architecture § tags](../../website-docs/guide/architecture.md#tags)

## Building blocks

1. Check [available-e-components.md](../../website-docs/contributing/available-e-components.md) before custom UI.
2. One primary E-Component per exploration unless explicitly designing a new shared pattern.
3. Extension UI goes **inside** E-Component slots (`#below`, `#result`) — not as siblings (provide/inject is descendant-only).

## Styling and deps

- Use `e-*` design-system classes from `src/main.css` — no hardcoded Tailwind color utilities on exploration UI. Do not re-list CSS class tables in prompts; read source.
- Import third-party libraries only in the exploration folder (or exploration-local modules), not in E-Components.

## Registration

Every new exploration needs an import in `src/explorations/REGISTRY.ts` or it will not appear in the app.

## Procedure

New exploration workflow: [add-exploration skill](../skills/add-exploration/SKILL.md) + [adding-an-exploration.md](../../website-docs/contributing/adding-an-exploration.md).

Tests green ≠ pedagogically done — human must review intro, usage, and examples.
